        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_01",
      "hash64": "D97FE04188CF308D",
      "text": "Dann lass uns gleich mal loslegen![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_02",
      "hash64": "D97FDD4188CF2B74",
      "text": "Als Erstes bekommst du es mit meiner Wenigkeit\\nzu tun. Ein Kampf gegen Cay von den Top Vier![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_03",
      "hash64": "D97FDE4188CF2D27",
      "text": "Glaub ja nicht, dass ich’s dir leicht machen\\nwerde, also leg dich besser ins Zeug![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_04",
      "hash64": "D97FDB4188CF280E",
      "text": "Ach, Mist... Gegen dich hatte ich einfach\\nkeine Chance![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_05",
      "hash64": "D97FDC4188CF29C1",
      "text": "Aber der Kampf hat trotzdem Spaß gemacht.\\nIch fühl mich irgendwie total erfrischt![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_06",
      "hash64": "D97FD94188CF24A8",
      "text": "Weißt du... Es gibt nicht viele Trainer, die in der\\nLage sind, die praktische Prüfung zu meistern...[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_07",
      "hash64": "D97FDA4188CF265B",
      "text": "Doch bei dir hab ich ein gutes Gefühl.\\nDir könnte das vielleicht gelingen.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_08",
      "hash64": "D97FD74188CF2142",
      "text": "Du darfst jetzt nur nicht leichtsinnig werden.\\nDas nächste Mitglied der Top Vier ist nämlich\\r\\nnoch mal ’ne Ecke stärker als ich! Häng dich rein![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_09",
      "hash64": "D97FD84188CF22F5",
      "text": "Heeey, du bist an der Reihe, Stöpsel![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "champ_0220_steel_01",
      "hash64": "9293552F48E4D169",
      "text": "Ich kommeeee![VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "champ_0220_steel_02",
      "hash64": "9293522F48E4CC50",
      "text": "Hast du etwa verloren, Cay?![VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_10",
      "hash64": "D983454188D21203",
      "text": "Aber hallo! [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302,0000)]ErSie ist echt stark, sieh dich besser vor![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_11",
      "hash64": "D983444188D21050",
      "text": "Ich werde euren Kampf als unbeteiligte\\nZuschauerin mitverfolgen. Räche mich, okay?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "champ_0220_steel_03",
      "hash64": "9293532F48E4CE03",
      "text": "Jaaa, mach ich![VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "champ_0220_ground_12",
      "hash64": "D983474188D21569",
      "text": "Dann will ich mir mal ein Bild davon machen,\\nwie weit du es hier noch bringen kannst![VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
